  "releaseNotes": "Preview 7 improves shared package-cache reliability with an exclusive cross-process\n      lock and pre-compile cleanup of stale app outputs, fixing intermittent AL1028 sharing\n      violations and ensuring rebuilt apps are collected. Config-driven builds can also\n      isolate dependency levels into separate compiler invocations.\n      See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
